    "UIName": "Lu Wei Bing LN-4B",
    "Id": "mechdef_lu_wei_bing_LN-4B",
    "Name": "Lu Wei Bing LN-4B",
    "Details": "The Lu Wei Bing is known for its durability in battle. This is due in part to its 16 tons of standard armor and the use of reinforced armor around its Cockpit. Constructed with Endo Steel, using four JumpJets, and powered by a 340 Light engine, the 'Mech has the same speed and tactical flexibility as the older Victor. The 'Mech's main weapon is its Class 20 LB-X Autocannon, which is found in its right arm and is fed by four tons of ammunition. Unlike its spiritual predecessor, the Lu Wei Bing has more long-range weapons at its disposal in a fight. This includes two left-arm-mounted Light PPCs and a single MML-5 found in the left torso. Lastly, the Lu Wei Bing mounts a powerful Angel ECM Suite, giving the 'Mech additional electronic screening from advance weaponry and sensors.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.15</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Right Upper</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_luweibing"
  },
